# Everything below is build output, and none of it is committed for the same
# reason `remotion-ad/public/app_screens` is not: a committed screenshot is a
# UI the app may no longer have, and a committed composition is a script the
# owner may since have rewritten. `npm run build` makes all of it from the
# scripts and the captures that exist right now.
